    featuredImagePrompt: "Conceptual visual representing the intersection of advanced artificial intelligence and modern warfare. A sleek, almost translucent AI chip, glowing with digital data patterns and intricate circuitry, is subtly integrated into the abstract silhouette of a long-range missile or a stealth drone, against a backdrop that hints at conflict—perhaps blurred, smoky city lights at dusk, or a fractured digital map of a battlefield. Emphasize the high-tech, precise, and potentially disruptive nature of AI in conflict. Digital art, dramatic lighting, cool color palette with accents of warm, electric blue and red glows emanating from the AI elements. The composition should be dynamic yet thought-provoking, avoiding explicit violence but conveying the gravity of technological escalation. High detail, 4K resolution, conceptual visuals style.",
