    featuredImagePrompt: "A dynamic, wide-angle, conceptual illustration depicting the intersection of finance and space. In the foreground, stylized financial graphs and digital stock ticker elements are superimposed over a launching SpaceX Starship rocket ascending into a starry night sky. The rocket has subtle streaks of light indicating motion. The background features a subtle, glowing constellation of Starlink satellites orbiting Earth, with a faint map of the globe visible. The color palette should blend deep blues, purples, and blacks of space with vibrant gold and green financial data highlights, suggesting growth and investment. The image should convey both the ambition of space exploration and the financial gravity of a major IPO, with a clean, modern, and slightly futuristic aesthetic, avoiding any generic stock photo feel.",
