      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A moderately bullish outlook for well-governed, ethically compliant tech companies in India, with a significant probability (60%) of strong investor interest for those demonstrating robust data protection and sustainable business models. However, high risks (40%) remain for companies with ethical or regulatory vulnerabilities, leading to potential underperformance or delayed listings.",
      potentialCatalysts: ["Further advancements and widespread adoption of AI across Indian industries.", "Government policies supporting indigenous tech innovation and digital infrastructure.", "Successful IPOs of ethically compliant and high-growth Indian tech unicorns.", "Increased foreign investment into India\'s deep tech and AI sectors."],
