      onChainMetrics: "For Securitize, relevant \'on-chain metrics\' translate to the growth and activity of tokenized assets on its platform, such as the record $4.3 billion in average tokenized assets under management (AUM). This indicates increasing utilization of blockchain rails for traditional financial products.",
      whaleActivity: "Whale activity is not directly applicable to Securitize as a public company in the traditional sense of tracking large crypto wallet movements. However, institutional investor activity in its stock or in the broader tokenization market would be the analogous \'whale activity\'.",
