      neutralCase: "The market might consolidate around current levels, with Bitcoin holding above $65,000, if the CPI data is in line with expectations, offering no strong impetus for either bullish or bearish sentiment. XRP could continue to trade sideways, constrained by regulatory uncertainty, while other altcoins might see modest gains or losses. The market would then await the next major catalyst, such as the CLARITY Act vote or subsequent economic data.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A probability-weighted outlook suggests a moderately bullish to neutral short-term outlook for Bitcoin and major altcoins, contingent on the CPI data. There\'s a higher probability of continued institutional interest in BTC/ETH. XRP faces a more neutral to bearish outlook until regulatory clarity emerges, with its price action heavily dependent on the CLARITY Act\'s progress. The overall market remains sensitive to macro shifts.",
